idle-cli (4.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split into the standalone idlescreen/cli repository.
  * Binary renamed idlescreen -> idle-cli; /usr/bin/idlescreen is now
    owned by the idlescreen router package, which forwards daemon verbs
    here. `idlescreen <verb>` invocations keep working via the router.
  * Package now Depends: idlescreen.

 -- IdleScreen <jerydleuck@gmail.com>  Sat, 13 Sep 2026 11:00:00 +0000

